"$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-balance font-heading text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl","children":"Why Browser Gaming Matters"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 text-pretty text-xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Browser games remove one of gaming’s biggest barriers: the distance between discovering something interesting and actually playing it. A link can become a playable experience in seconds, without an installer, a large download, or a complicated setup flow."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 space-y-10","children":[["$","section","Instant access changes discovery",{"className":"glass rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl","children":"Instant access changes discovery"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg","children":[["$","p","Traditional game discovery often ends at a store page. Browser gaming can continue directly into play. That shorter path makes experimentation easier, especially for players who are unsure what they want or only have a short amount of time.",{"children":"Traditional game discovery often ends at a store page. Browser gaming can continue directly into play. That shorter path makes experimentation easier, especially for players who are unsure what they want or only have a short amount of time."}],["$","p","This does not mean every browser game must be small or disposable. Modern web technology can support polished visuals, persistent progress, multiplayer systems, and sophisticated input. The opportunity is to present those experiences with the care normally associated with dedicated gaming platforms.",{"children":"This does not mean every browser game must be small or disposable. Modern web technology can support polished visuals, persistent progress, multiplayer systems, and sophisticated input. The opportunity is to present those experiences with the care normally associated with dedicated gaming platforms."}]]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L4","$L5"]}]]}]}],["$L6"],"$L7"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"JTEYWRjHJe3BjmgQMJqVi"}
4:["$","section","The browser is already everywhere",{"className":"glass rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl","children":"The browser is already everywhere"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg","children":[["$","p","A browser works across laptops, desktops, tablets, Chromebooks, and many mobile devices. That reach makes browser games useful for people who cannot install software, have limited storage, or move between devices.",{"children":"A browser works across laptops, desktops, tablets, Chromebooks, and many mobile devices. That reach makes browser games useful for people who cannot install software, have limited storage, or move between devices."}],["$","p","A well-designed platform can preserve continuity through profiles, favorites, recent activity, and cloud-synced progress while still keeping the first interaction immediate.",{"children":"A well-designed platform can preserve continuity through profiles, favorites, recent activity, and cloud-synced progress while still keeping the first interaction immediate."}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","li","No installation before play",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.2)] bg-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.06)] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium","children":"No installation before play"}],["$","li","Easy sharing through links",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.2)] bg-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.06)] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium","children":"Easy sharing through links"}],["$","li","Broad device availability",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.2)] bg-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.06)] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium","children":"Broad device availability"}],["$","li","A natural path from discovery to gameplay",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.2)] bg-[rgb(var(--accent-1)/0.06)] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium","children":"A natural path from discovery to gameplay"}]]}]]}]
5:["$","section","What the category still needs",{"className":"glass rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl","children":"What the category still needs"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg","children":[["$","p","Browser gaming deserves better organization, trustworthy information, stronger accessibility, and interfaces that make games—not advertisements or generic marketing—the main focus.",{"children":"Browser gaming deserves better organization, trustworthy information, stronger accessibility, and interfaces that make games—not advertisements or generic marketing—the main focus."}],["$","p","THE Gaming Horizon is being designed around that belief: instant play should feel premium, discovery should feel intentional, and a player’s activity should connect across the wider ecosystem.",{"children":"THE Gaming Horizon is being designed around that belief: instant play should feel premium, discovery should feel intentional, and a player’s activity should connect across the wider ecosystem."}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
